  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">신혜수석님의 게시글을 보고 스쳐지나갔을 자료를 공유합니다.<br>물의 깊이에따라 투과하는 빛의 파장이 달라져서 물속에서 보면 색깔이 다르게 보인다는 내용입니다.<br><br>From PBS LearningMedia:<br>Colors Underwater<br><a href=\"https://www.pbslearningmedia.org/resource/buac20-68-sci-ps-colorsunderwater/colors-underwater/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.pbslearningmedia.org/resource/buac20-68-sci-ps-colorsunderwater/colors-underwater/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Colors Underwater | PBS LearningMedia\" data-og-description=\"Observe how different wavelengths of light penetrate to different depths in the ocean and see how colored objects change appearance as they descend underwater. Use this resource to develop and use models of the absorption of light and observe how different\" data-og-host=\"www.pbslearningmedia.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.pbslearningmedia.org/resource/buac20-68-sci-ps-colorsunderwater/colors-underwater/\" data-og-url=\"https://www.pbslearningmedia.org/resource/buac20-68-sci-ps-colorsunderwater/colors-underwater/\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/yZXlF/bl4HvMpNfqd/oZF3CkkyNU9h1Abpzl9tE0/kakaolink40_original.png?width=1920&amp;height=1080\"><a href=\"https://www.pbslearningmedia.org/resource/buac20-68-sci-ps-colorsunderwater/colors-underwater/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.pbslearningmedia.org/resource/buac20-68-sci-ps-colorsunderwater/colors-underwater/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/yZXlF/bl4HvMpNfqd/oZF3CkkyNU9h1Abpzl9tE0/kakaolink40_original.png?width=1920&amp;height=1080\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Colors Underwater | PBS LearningMedia</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Observe how different wavelengths of light penetrate to different depths in the ocean and see how colored objects change appearance as they descend underwater. Use this resource to develop and use models of the absorption of light and observe how different</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.pbslearningmedia.org</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>1881년에 어떤 분이 해조류 서식분포(녹조류,갈조류,홍조류)와 수심에 따른 빛의 파장별 빛 투과를 연결지으셨하더라구요.  현재 얼마나 과학적으로 의미있는지는 추가 자료를 찾아봐야할것 같긴 합니다. 생물은 워낙 복잡하니까요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/693a9c6a4856b1939ee885233c0f8ee63bf39cdb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/693a9c6a4856b1939ee885233c0f8ee63bf39cdb\" data-origin-width=\"1018\" data-origin-height=\"1359\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv9jorhnh4t77pmbods3rwied@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"817\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv9jorhnh4t77pmbods3rwied/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33274363279&amp;signature=yOiUfVlh2O7iHUHtUmAeudHotnQ%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"817\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv9jorhnh4t77pmbods3rwied?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2OWpvcmhuaDR0NzdwbWJvZHMzcndpZWQiLCJ0aWQiOiI1ZDYxNTc1My1iZmE5LTQ4NWUtOTNjYi0zNGIzNjVkZDViMDAiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODYxMDd9.bjuIRIj5nP3z77Vy-DMktEJRdo-MbGd1p6bwR3Yo0UJz6gr826SJpNmfut7_i83Xtn674s4WmmbgktHcshmnvQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"817\" height=\"